    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Churches Estate Agents are delighted to present this beautifully maintained three-bedroom home with an attic conversion and a sun filled south westerly rear garden that is perfectly positioned in the highly sought-after Parc na Silla development.\r\n\r\nNestled in a leafy, mature cul-de-sac, No. 10 The Rise is in excellent condition throughout. Its superb location offers easy access to the DART, M50, a choice of excellent schools, Cornelscourt Shopping Centre and a host of local amenities making it an ideal choice for families, first-time buyers or those looking to downsize without compromise.\r\n\r\nThe property features off-street parking on a cobblestone driveway with a neat lawn leading to an inviting entrance hallway with wooden flooring. A bright and welcoming sitting room sets the tone for the home followed by a spacious open-plan kitchen and dining area to the rear. This stylish space is enhanced by modern fitted units, built-in electric appliances, tiled flooring and direct access to the sunny rear garden that is perfect for al fresco dining and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the sense of style continues with three well-proportioned bedrooms including a master en suite. Each room offers clever storage solutions or fitted wardrobes and elegant wooden flooring. A fully tiled modern family bathroom with a three-piece suite completes this level.\r\n\r\nThe converted attic accessed from the landing provides an excellent additional space that can serve multiple purposes to include an ideal for a home office, short term guest accommodation, or hobby area.\r\n\r\nThe private rear garden enjoys a perfect south-westerly orientation, laid in lawn with a stone patio area offering an inviting space to relax or entertain.\r\n\r\nParc na Silla is a highly desirable residential enclave offering a peaceful setting with excellent connectivity. Public transport is well served, with the QBC just meters away, DART within walking distance at Shankill and the LUAS at nearby Cherrywood providing easy access to the city. The surrounding areas to include Cherrywood continues to thrive with new local businesses and amenities, adding further appeal to this wonderful location.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: 3.58m x 1.78m \r\nSitting Room: 5.6m x 3.35m \r\nKitchen & Diner: 5.25m x 4.47m \r\n\r\nLanding: 3.37m x 1.61 \r\nMaster Bedroom 3m x 3.49m \r\nEnsuite 2.27m x 1.38m \r\nBedroom 2:  2.94m x 2.90m \r\nSingle Room: 2.30m x 2.66m \r\nMain Bathroom: 1.92m x 2.02m\r\nAttic:  3.94m x 3.70m"
      },
